---
import Layout from "../layouts/Layout.astro";
const links = [
	{
		href: "/browse",
		title: "Browse",
		description: "Find a title by format, status, and season.",
	},
	{
		href: "/season",
		title: "Seasonal",
		description: "See what is airing right now.",
	},
	{
		href: "/schedule",
		title: "Schedule",
		description: "Keep pace with the coming week.",
	},
	{
		href: "/rankings",
		title: "Rankings",
		description: "Start with the titles audiences love.",
	},
];
---
<Layout title="About — AnimeKatana"><section class="page-band"><div class="page-shell"><p class="eyebrow">Our approach</p><h1 class="display-title mt-2 text-5xl sm:text-6xl">About AnimeKatana</h1><p class="mt-5 max-w-2xl text-lg leading-relaxed text-parchment-700">A quieter place to discover anime: more guide than feed, more context than noise.</p></div></section><article class="page-shell max-w-3xl py-12 sm:py-16"><div class="space-y-10 text-lg leading-8 text-parchment-700"><section><h2 class="display-title text-2xl">What this is</h2><p class="mt-4">AnimeKatana is an editorial anime destination built around a simple idea: discovery should feel like reading a well-curated magazine, not scrolling a generic dashboard. Every title has a proper guide, not just a card with a play button.</p><p class="mt-4">Catalogue data comes from AniList, giving each guide context around seasons, studios, staff, characters, and more. Playback is requested from AniSource only when you choose to watch.</p></section><section><h2 class="display-title text-2xl">Designed to settle in</h2><p class="mt-4">The interface borrows from print: warm paper, clear ink, muted accents, and type that rewards attention. It stays compact and practical on small screens without filling the page with visual noise.</p></section><section><h2 class="display-title text-2xl">How it is built</h2><p class="mt-4">Astro renders catalogue pages on the server for speed and SEO. Qwik is reserved for interaction where it matters, including search and playback. HLS playback code loads only when a selected stream needs it.</p></section><section class="paper-card p-6 sm:p-8"><p class="eyebrow">Start exploring</p><h2 class="display-title mt-2 text-2xl">A guide for every way in</h2><div class="mt-6 grid gap-3 sm:grid-cols-2">{links.map((link) => <a href={link.href} class="rounded-md border border-parchment-200 p-4 hover:border-evergreen-400 hover:bg-evergreen-50"><h3 class="font-serif text-lg font-bold text-evergreen-950">{link.title} <span aria-hidden="true">→</span></h3><p class="mt-1 text-sm leading-relaxed text-parchment-700">{link.description}</p></a>)}</div></section></div></article></Layout>
